<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Multi-Purpose year net up.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Multi-Purpose year net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     191.08	 vs	 131.49</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     25.4	  vs	  17.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		 943.43	 vs     2,874.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 363.35	 vs	 525.85</p>
<p>    Minorities    less    58.11	 vs  less 216.72</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  loss  0.22	 vs  gain  23.55</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	1.0	  vs	   1.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Multi-Purpose Holdings Bhd. It is involved in finance, gaming and property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
